<title>UK: Societe Generale sets 10 bln yen bond.</title>
<headline>Societe Generale sets 10 bln yen bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Nikko Europe Plc.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SOCIETE GENERALE</p>
<p> AMT    10 BLN YEN    COUPON     *1.0	MATURITY    30.JAN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.0     PAY DATE    30.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  57 BP     LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (M) 10	SALE LIMITS US/UK/FR/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  FRANCE    TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> NOTES	*LINKED TO PERFORMANCE OF ARCHER FUND PLC. MINIMUM</p>
<p>		 COUPON IS ONE PERCENT</p>
<p>		 ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
